---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { withBase } from '../lib/paths';
---
<BaseLayout title="About the Studio — POYARA" description="Meet the founder-led studio combining 14+ years of 3D production with scientific visualization, real-time experiences and AI-native product development.">
  <section class="page-header wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT / 04</p>
    <h1>Built by a maker.<br /><em>Driven by questions.</em></h1>
    <p>POYARA is an independent, founder-led studio developing interactive experiences and digital products where design, technology and clear problem-framing meet.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="section wrap case-grid">
    <div class="case-main">
      <h2>Where the practice began</h2>
      <p class="body-large">The founder's background is in 3D production: more than 14 years working across modeling, texturing, lighting and animation. That work expanded into medical and scientific visualization, where accuracy of explanation matters as much as visual quality.</p>
      <h2>Why it became a product studio</h2>
      <p class="body-large">Real-time engines and browser-based graphics made it possible to move beyond finished images into experiences people can control. AI-assisted software development opened another path: a small independent practice could explore product ideas through working prototypes, not just presentations.</p>
      <h2>How we work today</h2>
      <p class="body-large">POYARA combines product reasoning, visual design and implementation. The operating principle is simple: define the problem, create something testable, study what happens and improve it. AI is part of the production workflow, while product direction and quality judgment remain the founder's responsibility.</p>
      <h2>A note on scale</h2>
      <p class="body-large">This is a founder-led studio, not a large agency disguised as one. Collaborators may join for specific disciplines or projects. Public work is described with its real stage and contribution, without presenting demonstrations as customer deployments.</p>
      <div class="inline-actions">
        <a class="text-link" href={withBase('work/')}>Inspect selected work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/MaxLightner" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Public development profile <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="case-meta">
      <p class="eyebrow">WORKING PRINCIPLES</p>
      <div><span>Model</span><strong>Independent · Founder-led</strong></div>
      <div><span>Experience</span><strong>14+ years in 3D production</strong></div>
      <div><span>Background</span><strong>Medical & scientific visualization</strong></div>
      <div><span>Method</span><strong>Frame · Make · Refine</strong></div>
      <div><span>Current focus</span><strong>Real-time experiences & AI-native prototypes</strong></div>
    </aside>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
